@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Payment - Pay for Order (COD)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer placed a COD order.

Postcondition:
Once every non-cancelled line is delivered: the order is
DELIVERED and the COD payment is COMPLETED. The COD
amount follows cancelled lines and the payment fails if
the whole order is cancelled.
end note
:Choose COD at checkout;
|System|
:Create the COD payment as PENDING;
|Customer|
:Receive the parcel and pay the courier;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Record the shipment as DELIVERED when the seller updates it;
:Check every non-cancelled line of the order is in a delivered shipment;
if (Some lines are not delivered yet?) then (Yes)
  :Keep the payment PENDING and the order unchanged;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Move the order to DELIVERED and complete the COD payment;
|Customer|
:View the order and payment status;
stop

@enduml
